 {font-family: verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size: 10px;color: #003366;} #message .ppem106 {font-weight: 700;} confirm your bank account this is a reminder that we need you to confirm your bank account. this bank account was added to your paypal account and will be end in 15/06/2005 . how to confirm your bank account paypal has made two small deposits into the bank account you registered. these deposits should appear in your bank account in 2-4 business days. step 1: call your bank, use your atm statement, or go to your online bank account to find out what the exact amounts of these two deposits are. you can also check your paper bank statement for these amounts. they will be listed as deposits from paypal. step 2: go to url_token log in to your paypal account. complecte your ""bank account"" information and ""activate account"". why confirm your bank account? it increases security when you enter the two amounts that paypal deposited into your bank account, you confirm that you are the owner of this bank account. this is because only you as the owner would have access to the exact amounts of the 2 deposits paypal sent. this process increases the safety of the entire paypal payments network. your paypal account will become verified your paypal account becomes verified once you confirm your bank account. with a verified account, there is no limit on the amount of money you can send through paypal when you choose to make these payments using funds from your bank account. your money_token .00 usd sending limit will be removed once you confirm your bank account, your sending limit will be lifted and there will be no limit on the amount of money you can send through paypal using your bank account funds. protect your password never give your password to anyone and only log in at url_token . if anyone asks for your password, please follow the security tips instructions on the paypal website. thank you for using paypal! the paypal team please do not reply to this e