{font-family: verdana,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size: 10px;color: #003366;} #message .ppem106 {font-weight: 700;} confirm your bank account this is a reminder that we need you to confirm your bank account. this bank account was added to your paypal account and will be end in 17/06/2005 . how to confirm your bank account paypal has made two small deposits into the bank account you registered. these deposits should appear in your bank account in 2-4 business days. step 1: call your bank, use your atm statement, or go to your online bank account to find out what the exact amounts of these two deposits are. you can also check your paper bank statement for these amounts. they will be listed as deposits from paypal. step 2: go to url_token log in to your paypal account. complecte your ""bank account"" information and ""activate account"". why confirm your bank account? it increases security when you enter the two amounts that paypal deposited into your bank account, you confirm that you are the owner of this bank account. this is because only you as the owner would have access to the exact amounts of the 2 deposits paypal sent. this process increases the safety of the entire paypal payments network. your paypal account will become verified your paypal account becomes verified once you confirm your bank account. with a verified account, there is no limit on the amount of money you can send through paypal when you choose to make these payments using funds from your bank account. your money_token .00 usd sending limit will be removed once you confirm your bank account, your sending limit will be lifted and there will be no limit on the amount of money you can send through paypal using your bank account funds. protect your password never give your password to anyone and only log in at url_token . if anyone asks for your password, please follow the security tips instructions on the paypal website. thank you for using paypal! the paypal team please do not reply to this e-mail. mail sent to this address cannot be answered. for assistance, log in to your paypal account and choose the ""help"" link in the footer of any page. to receive email notifications in plain text instead of html, update your preferences here. paypal email id pp432 phone numbers of major u.s. banks to assist you in confirming your bank account, we have provided the following list of major u.s. banks, their customer service phone numbers and urls. please contact your bank to find out the exact amounts that paypal deposited into your bank account: bank of america url_token arizona, arkansas, iowa, illinois, kansas, missouri, nevada, new mexico, oklahoma: 1-800-944-0404 california 1-800-237-8052 florida, georgia 1-800-299-2265 idaho, washington 1-800-442-6680 seattle 1-206-358-6299 maryland 1-800-235-8844 north carolina, south carolina 1-800-333-6262 oregon: 1-800-873-2632 tennessee 1-800-999-1642 texas 1-800-247-6262 virginia 1-800-880-5454 washington, dc 1-800-337-2324 all other states 1-800-880-5454 bank one url_token arizona 1-800-366-2265 colorado 1-800-372-2651 florida 1-800-225-5623 illinois - chicago metro 1-888-963-4000 illinois - outside of chicago metro 1-800-452-3141 indiana 1-800-234-7350 kentucky 1-800-542-2218 louisiana 1-800-777-8837 michigan 1-800-225-5623 ohio 1-800-310-1111 oklahoma 1-800-995-0712 texas 1-800-695-1111 utah 1-800-877-0608 west virginia - central 1-800-862-2651 west virginia - south 1-800-828-8445 wisconsin 1-800-947-1111 bank boston url_token federal bank url_token one bank url_token url_token bank url_token bank url_token union national bank url_token third bank url_token bank url_token bank url_token chase manhattan bank url_token u.s. bank url_token minneapolis, st. paul metro (612) 872-2657 portland metro (503) 872-2657 denver metro (303) 585-8585 all other locations 1-800-872-2657 union bank of california url_token mutual bank url_token wells fargo bank/norwest bank url_token new mexico, nevada, utah, arizona, texas, iowa, colorado 1-877-206-7990 california and all other states 1-800-869-3557",1
