rtunities for finding women _will_ be scarce. again, these > > > situations are great, provided everyone is aware that the relationship > > > is a contractual one -- he wants a maid, a dog and a prostitute he > > > doesn't have to pay, and she wants a country that isn't impoverished > > > and teeming with aids. a contract, versus a true love-interest > > > marriage. > > > > > > egh. i really need to stop analyzing your posts to this extent. i > > > blame law school and my cat. > > > > > > -bb > > > > > > alb> - adam l. ""duncan"" beberg > > > alb> url_token > > > alb> email_token > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > > -- > > ""i don't take no stocks in mathematics, anyway"" --huckleberry finn > > > > > > > > > > > > -- > ""i don't take no stocks in mathematics, anyway"" --huckleberry finn > > > > > -- ""i don't take no stocks in mathematics, anyway"" --huckleberry finn",0
