t and kuiper belts are utterly devoid of gay people as well. isn't this remarkable? > a few nifty gaybars, but thats a different story) b) that bored/sex > obsessed/recreationally free to pursue sex that often, with that many > partners or that they'd even want that many partners. this doesn't happen because it couldn't happen. no one would want to. because you feel that way. correct? > qualify yourself, or at least lower your outrageous numbers. i didn't expect so much reflexive knee-jerking on this list.",0
