 was accessed by a third party. because protecting the security of your account is our primary concern, we have limited access to sensitive paypal account features. we understand that this may be an inconvenience but please understand that this temporary limitation is for your protection. (your case id for this reason is pp-121-601-924.) how can i restore my account access? please click here and complete the steps to remove limitations. completing all of the checklist items will automatically restore your account access.",1
