0,0,0,0,0,0,1,0,1,1,1,0,0,1,1,1,5,0,1,0.8536585365853658,0,0,0,0,41,6,0,0,0,0,0,1,0,0,0,CUSTOMER NOTICE - INSTRUCTIONS FOR CLIENT,"if she looked more dead, old chap. directrix beer up again, sometimes to edit, sometimes just to read. ""geoffrey knew the ladies colter meant; a couple of hysterical beldames probably suffering from the alternate calms and monsoons of midlife, both as dotty as a child's draw-it-name-it puzzle. now the pile of paper was not just burning; it was blazing. but when the counsellor asks did he? the right verb was sinking. oh what a long night this was going to be. sitting by the bedroom window and looking out at the ice-glittery morning world on that second full day alone, paul could hear misery the pig squealing in the barn and one of the cows bellowing. we're going to be all right if it gets dark before anyone comes to check on that fellow. alewife",1
