t, click the profile sub-tab, then click the notifications link under account information. changes may take up to 10 days to be reflected in our mailings. paypal will not sell or rent any of your personally identifiable information to third parties. for more information about the security of your information, read our privacy policy at url_token copyright © 2006 paypal inc. all rights reserved. designated trademarks and brands are the property of their respective owners. paypal is located at 2211 n. first st., san jose, ca 95131.",1
