a small high-risk program to open ports in your pc ) and they can spy on you by that small program to know your passwords . 2nd , you may accept files from an unknown person that have the same mission . 3rd , you may have accessed your online account via a public pc . ---------------------------------------------------------- thank you, wells fargo - online banking. | | | �� 1995 - 2006 wells fargo. all rights reserved.",1
