e this email in text format, change your notification preferences . see our privacy policy and user agreement if you have questions about ebay's communication policies. privacy policy: url_token agreement: url_token opyright � 2007 ebay, inc. all rights reserved. designated trademarks and brands are the property of their respective owners. ebay and the ebay logo are registered trademarks or trademarks of ebay, inc. ebay is located at 2145 hamilton avenue, san jose, ca 95125.",1
