0,0,0,0,0,0,1,0,1,1,1,0,0,1,1,1,5,0,0,0.09836065573770492,0,0,1,0,61,10,0,0,0,0,0,1,0,0,0,"Please Update Your Details. [Sun, 28 Jan 2007 18:05:11 -0800]","i was wrong to ask. coed byrd blood squirted from the lawnboy's grass-exhaust in an amazing jet. old enough and bright enough, maybe, to spill some kerosene around a cheap liquor bottle, then light a candle, and put the candle in the middle of the kerosene. on their way to annie's laughing place, maybe? she looked honestly sorry; tears stood in her eyes. they had been dreadful. so why had they stayed? she slurped up the remainder of her sundae in five huge spoonfuls that would have left paul's throat gray with frostbite. the neat handwriting below this clipping read los angeles call, january 29th, 1962. bulk",1
