0,0,0,0,0,0,1,0,1,1,1,0,0,1,1,1,4,0,0,0.08571428571428572,0,0,1,0,70,12,0,0,0,0,0,1,0,0,0,"Service message from Fifth Third Bank -Sun, 25 Feb 2007 03:07:02 -0800","""shall i go on? assent chianti annie gunned it fiercely. during the next three weeks, paul sheldon felt surrounded by a queer electric peacefulness. ""christ, can't you see? ""ultimately he knew this to be the truth. david and goliath, paul thought. then began to diminish. in it misery spent a cheerful country weekend boffing growler, ian's irish setter. and he had a little extra information on which to judge just how much of her gear wasn't stowed right, didn't he? asthma",1
