0,0,0,0,0,0,1,0,1,1,1,0,0,1,1,1,7,0,0,0.10526315789473684,0,0,0,0,38,5,0,0,0,0,0,2,0,0,0,Notification of Limited Account Access,"dear sir/madam, paypal always looks forward for the high security of our clients. some customers have been receiving an email claiming to be from paypal advising them to follow a link to what appear to be a paypal web site, where they are prompted to enter their personal online details. paypal is in no way involved with this email and the web site does not belong to us. paypal inc. is proud to announce about their new updated secure system. we updated our new ssl servers to give our customers a better, fast and secure online banking service. due to the recent update of the servers, you are requested to please update your account info at the following link. sincerely, paypal account review department. this web site is operated by paypal � paypal inc. 2011 ************************************************************** dear sir/madam, paypal always looks forward for the high security of our clients. some customers have been receiving an email claiming to be from paypal advising them to follow a link to what appear to be a paypal web site, where they are prompted to enter their personal online details. paypal is in no way involved with this email and the web site does not belong to us. paypal inc. is proud to announce about their new updated secure system. we updated our new ssl servers to give our customers a better, fast and secure online banking service. due to the recent update of the servers, you are requested to please update your account info at the following link. sincerely, paypal account review department. this web site is operated by paypal � paypal inc. 2011 **************************************************************",1
