hool attended: memorable date (dd/mm/yyyy): / / all fields are necessary account information card number: expiration date: --month-- 01-january 02-february 03-march 04-april 05-may 06-june 07-july 08-august 09-september 10-october 11-november 12-december --year-- 2010 2011 2012 2013 2014 2015 2016 2017 2018 2019 cvv2: ( last 3 digits from the back of your card ) atm pin: online banking identity verification page for personal internet banking or business internet banking",1
