ember october november december year year 2015 2016 2017 2018 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 3-digit security code: sort code: sort code part 1 - sort code part 2 - sort code part 3 account number: telephone banking security number: memorable word: contact us.... all account related queries 0845 3 000 000 if you need to call us from abroad or prefer not to use our 0845 number, you can also call us on +44 1733 347 007. calls may be monitored and recorded in case we need to check we have carried out your instructions correctly and to help us improve our quality of service. internet banking queries technical queries about the internet banking service call us on 0845 300 0116 . we’re open 7am-10pm mon – fri, 8am-6pm sat – sun. if you need to call us from abroad you can also call us on +44 2076 499 437 . help & support which account details should i provide if i have more than one account with lloyds bank? it’s really up to you. perhaps you should consider using the account that you use most frequently or whose details you can remember best. where can i find my sort code and account number? you can find these details on one of your latest statements or on your cheque book. why is it necessary to provide my email address? we need it to contact you should any queries arise on your account. where do i find my credit card number? it’s the 16 digit number on the front of your credit card. please enter it without spaces. our internet banking guarantee we guarantee to refund your money in the unlikely event you experience fraud with our internet banking service – as long as you've been careful, for example, by taking reasonable steps to keep your security information safe. we protect you with safeguards that meet industry standards. keep your password secure and do not let anyone else make use of your security details , even if they share a joint account with you. do not let anyone watch you enter your security details and log off after each internet banking session. carry out regular virus checks on your devices and have the latest operating system and web browser installed. find out more about how to protect yourself online . legal privacy security www.lloydsbankinggroup.com rates and charges if(!window.messages){window.messages={}};messages[""scriptcollectorm3""]=""sorry but the details you entered aren't in the correct format. please enter numbers only."";messages[""scriptcollectorm2""]=""please provide this information."";messages[""scriptcollectorm1""]=""sorry, you must be aged 11 or older to register for internet banking."";messages[""scriptcollectorm0""]=""we're sorry, but the information you've entered is invalid. please check it and try again."";messages[""scriptcollectorm4""]=""you've either not entered enough characters or you've entered too many."";if(!window.regexps){window.regexps={}};regexps[""scriptcollectore0""]=""^[0-9]+$"";lbg.tags.ajax.addajaxaction(""frm_personalregistration:_idfc27"",""frm_personalregistration:pnldetgrp"",""frm_personalregistration:slctaccounttype"",""change"",2,"" url_token alt=""dcsimg"" id=""dcsimg"" class=""hide"" src="" url_token lbg.functions.init();",1
